.3515625, 0.13647934794425964], "id": 195, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 34}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [252], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["{\n  \"image_overview\": {\n    \"theme\": \"China Mobile × Migu rural revitalization promotional poster (Yunnan coffee theme)\",\n    \"purpose\": \"Promote China Mobile Yunnan and Migu's support for Baoshan coffee industry and rural revitalization, evoking a sense of adventure and hometown pride\",\n    \"style\": \"Photorealistic background with hand-drawn doodle-style overlays, warm and uplifting travel aesthetic\",\n    \"color_palette\": \"Natural greens and grays (background), white and bright yellow (text/graphics), warm tones of the motorcycle scene\"\n  },\n  \"background_scene\": {\n    \"setting\": \"Rear-view shot of a paved two-lane road/bridge stretching straight ahead, flanked by lush green mountains and forest, under bright daylight. The road leads into a scenic valley, creating a sense of journey and forward movement.\",\n    \"subjects\": {\n      \"central_focus\": \"Two people riding a motorcycle away from the camera. The passenger (rear rider) wears a bright yellow t-shirt, green pants, and sneakers, raising one hand to take a photo with a phone, embodying the 'travel/adventure' vibe. The driver (front rider) is partially visible, focused on driving.\",\n      \"vehicle\": \"A standard Chinese-style motorcycle, with the rear view including the license plate area and exhaust.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"branding_and_text_elements\": [\n    {\n      \"location\": \"Top left corner\",\n      \"content\": \"China Mobile logo + text '中国移动 China Mobile', '5G⁺', '咪咕'\",\n      \"purpose\": \"Identify the collaboration partners: China Mobile (telecom) and Migu (digital content platform)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"location\": \"Upper center/right, overlaid on the background\",\n      \"content\": \"背上行囊\\n有去远方的勇气\\n也有归乡的底气\",\n      \"style\": \"Large white hand-drawn brushstroke text, with '勇气' and '底气' highlighted in bright yellow. Small doodles (sun, clouds, coffee beans, birds) surround the text.\",\n      \"translation\": \"Pack your bags / Have the courage to go far / And the confidence to return home\",\n      \"theme\": \"Balances wanderlust and hometown pride, aligning with the rural revitalization narrative\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"location\": \"Lower center, above the search bar\",\n      \"content\": \"云南移动携手咪咕，助力保山乡村振兴，向世界传递中国咖啡的味道。\",\n      \"style\": \"Yellow and white text, with '云南移动携手咪咕' in yellow, the rest in white\",\n      \"purpose\": \"Explicitly state the campaign's mission: supporting Baoshan's coffee industry and rural revitalization, promoting Chinese coffee globally\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"location\": \"Bottom banner\",\n      \"content\": \"咪咕cafe #好咖啡，从保山走来#\",\n      \"style\": \"Yellow background label with white text, plus a magnifying glass icon, mimicking a search bar UI element\",\n      \"purpose\": \"Brand the 'Migu Cafe' initiative and the campaign hashtag\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"graphic_overlays\": {\n    \"style\": \"Simple white/yellow line doodles matching the text's hand-drawn aesthetic\",\n    \"elements\": [\n      \"Sun with spiral lines (top right)\",\n      \"Clouds (top left/right)\",\n      \"Coffee beans (middle left/right)\",\n      \"Bird silhouettes (middle right)\",\n      \"Coffee cup doodle on the passenger's raised hand\",\n      \"Exhaust smoke doodle on the motorcycle's tailpipe\"\n    ],\n    \"function\": \"Enhance the whimsical, travel-themed vibe and reinforce the coffee motif\"\n  },\n  \"key_messages\": [\n    \"Encourage young people to explore while valuing their hometown roots\",\n    \"Highlight China Mobile and Migu's role in empowering Baoshan's coffee farmers and rural development\",\n    \"Promote Baoshan coffee as a premium Chinese product to a 